{
  "root_node": "source.raw.orders",
  "cause": "upstream_data",
  "action": "escalate",
  "evidence": "The stg_orders model has a contract that order_date must be DATE, but the source raw.orders.o_orderdate column is VARCHAR. Profile of raw.orders.o_orderdate shows 600 values (e.g., \"unknown\") cannot be converted to DATE, so conversion would be lossy. According to policy, type/format changes can only be patched if lossless. Therefore the issue originates in the upstream source data, not in model code."
}
